 abstract = {The OSGi Alliance defines an open, modular, and scalable service delivery platform. The DPWS specification standardizes the process of consuming and exposing Web Services in a lightweight footprint. In our work, we provide a solution for the mutual integration of OSGi and DPWS. The approach adopts the mechanisms of distributed object systems. It employs OSGi-based service proxies and service skeletons.},
